-- Lesson 4. Putting values inside text.

please remember name is "Ada"
please remember age is 11

please show "{name} is {age} years old."
please show "Next year she will be {age plus 1}."

-- Anything that is a value anywhere is a value inside braces.
please remember things is an empty list
please add "bread" to things
please show "The list holds {the number of items in things} thing."
